The integration setup and climate implementation in
custom_components/schluter_heat_extended/__init__.py,
custom_components/schluter_heat_extended/climate.py, and
custom_components/schluter_heat_extended/const.py are modified from
the Home Assistant Schluter integration. Changes include a separate
integration domain, bundled API, expanded thermostat actions and
weekly schedule handling, custom authentication behavior, and
per-device energy reporting integration.

